## 💳 Payment & Fundraising Flow

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as 👤 User (Web/Mobile)
    participant FE as 🌐 Frontend
    participant BE as ⚙️ FastAPI Backend
    participant RZP as 💳 Razorpay
    participant DB as 🐘 PostgreSQL

    Note over U,DB: 🎗️ Donation / Fee Payment Flow

    U->>FE: Clicks "Donate" or "Pay Fee"
    FE->>BE: POST /payments/create-order
    BE->>RZP: Create Razorpay Order
    RZP-->>BE: Order ID + Details
    BE-->>FE: Return Order ID
    FE->>U: Opens Razorpay Checkout Modal
    U->>RZP: Completes Payment (Card/UPI/etc)
    RZP-->>FE: Payment Success Callback
    FE->>BE: POST /payments/verify
    BE->>RZP: Verify Signature
    RZP-->>BE: Signature Valid ✅
    BE->>DB: Save Transaction Record
    DB-->>BE: Saved
    BE-->>FE: 200 OK · Payment Confirmed
    FE-->>U: "Payment Successful! 🎉"
```

