## 🏟️ Venue Booking Flow

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    USER(["👤 User / Admin"]) --> BROWSE["🔍 Browse Venues\n/dashboard/venues"]
    BROWSE --> SELECT["📋 Select a Venue\nView availability slots"]
    SELECT --> HOLD["🔒 Place a Hold\nTemporary seat reservation\n(60s auto-expiry check)"]
    HOLD --> CHECKOUT["🛒 Checkout\n/checkout"]
    CHECKOUT --> PAYMENT["💳 Pay via Razorpay"]
    PAYMENT -->|Success| CONFIRM["✅ Booking Confirmed\n/bookings"]
    PAYMENT -->|Failure| CANCEL["❌ Hold Released\nSlot available again"]

    subgraph BACKGROUND["⏰ Background Job (Every 60s)"]
        SCHED["Hold Expiry Service\nAuto-releases expired holds"]
    end
    HOLD -.->|"If not paid in time"| SCHED
    SCHED -.->|"Releases hold"| SELECT
```

