## 📊 Complete System At a Glance

| Layer | Technology | Purpose |
|-------|-----------|---------|
| **Web Frontend** | Next.js 14 (React) | Club admin & member dashboards |
| **Mobile App** | Flutter (Dart) | Cross-platform mobile experience |
| **Backend API** | FastAPI (Python) | REST API, business logic |
| **Database** | PostgreSQL | All persistent data |
| **Auth** | JWT Tokens | Stateless authentication |
| **Payments** | Razorpay | Fee collection & donations |
| **File Storage** | Cloud Storage | Documents, media files |
| **Background Jobs** | APScheduler | Hold expiry, cleanup |
| **Email** | Email Service | Verification & notifications |

---

> **Three User Roles at Entry:** Club Admin → Full control · Members (Player/Coach/Parent/Referee) → Role-based access · Venue Owners → Venue management
